        "committer": {
          "name": "Sergey Cheremencev",
          "email": "scherementsev@ddn.com",
          "date": "2026-11-11 15:52:21.000000000",
          "tz": 180
        },
        "subject": "LU-18859 quota: don't LBUG on invalid default quota request",
        "message": "LU-18859 quota: don't LBUG on invalid default quota request\n\nqmt_get() asserted that a request for default quota always carries\nid 0:\n\n  LASSERT( !is_default || id->qid_uid == 0 )\n\nA client can reach this path with a non-zero id, for example via\nllapi_quotactl() with LUSTRE_Q_GETDEFAULT, or when root squash\nrewrites id 0 into a non-zero squashed id. That is a malformed\nrequest but it crashes the whole MDS. Return -EPROTO to the client\ninstead of asserting on the server.\n\nFixes: 530881fe4ee2 (\"LU-7816 quota: add default quota setting support\")\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-4-8\nChange-Id: If5e364fb772d8e9b837130d788a08d99197c9096\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
